      "post_id": "2090168856409190883",
      "url": "https://x.com/mck_11_11/status/2090168856409190883",
      "text": "@Temu @FedEx\nYour support only seems to help when someone leaves a picture of the delivery.\nMy last order was marked delivered by FedEx, but they left zero delivery proof and I still haven’t received the package.\nTrying to contact FedEx has been the absolute worst experience — their AI can’t understand basic human speech and can’t even process a simple tracking number.\nPlease look into this.",
      "original_text": "@Temu @FedEx\nYour support only seems to help when someone leaves a picture of the delivery.\nMy last order was marked delivered by FedEx, but they left zero delivery proof and I still haven’t received the package.\nTrying to contact FedEx has been the absolute worst experience — their AI can’t understand basic human speech and can’t even process a simple tracking number.\nPlease look into this.",
      "links": [],
      "translation_zh": "@Temu @FedEx\n你们的客服似乎只有在有人留下配送照片时才会帮忙。\n我的上一单被FedEx标记为已送达，但他们没有留下任何配送证明，而我到现在还没收到包裹。\n试图联系FedEx简直是最糟糕的体验——他们的AI听不懂基本的人类语言，甚至连一个简单的追踪号码都处理不了。\n请调查一下这件事。",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "summary_zh": "用户讨论物流、配送或包裹追踪体验。",
